"technical code" means a voluntary industry code
prepared under Chapter 3 of Part VII;

"technical standards forum" means a forum designated
under section 184;

"transmit" or "transmission" means to cause any
emission of unguided electromagnetic energy in any part
of the spectrum;

"voluntary industry code" means a voluntary industry
code prepared under Chapter 9 of Part V.

